<title>USA: U.S. DAP prices drop, ammonia unchanged.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP prices drop, ammonia unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices for diammonium phosphate (DAP) from central Florida dropped sharply as poor export demand has shippers diverting export supplies into the domestic market, cash dealers said.</p>
<p>DAP prices basis the central Louisiana Gulf were steady, while ammonia values eased slightly.</p>
<p>			   Dlrs/short ton	 Chg from Monday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	  168-170		 DN 6.00</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf    185-187		     unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		195		 DN 2.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
